    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a3", "label": "Answer", "default": "No hormones of any kind. Our botanicals and probiotics work with your body's own systems — steadying the thermostat, calming the stress response, and nourishing the estrobolome — rather than introducing hormones from outside. That's why so many women who can't or won't do HRT choose Womankind."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q4"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q4", "label": "Question", "default": "How long until I feel a difference?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a4", "label": "Answer", "default": "Most women feel the first shift within 2–3 weeks — flushes feeling lighter, the first flush-free afternoon, a drier night. A clear pattern by month one. The full effect — fewer, milder flushes, steady sleep, the fog lifting — lands by month three, once the gut-hormone axis rebalances. That's why our guarantee is 90 days: your body needs the time, and you shouldn't have to gamble it."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q5"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q5", "label": "Question", "default": "Is it too late for me? I'm past 50."},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a5", "label": "Answer", "default": "No. The systems our formula supports — the hypothalamus-thermostat axis and the estrobolome — don't switch off at menopause. Women in their mid-50s and beyond report the same pattern: flushes down from a dozen a day to a handful a week, dry sheets, real sleep. We built this for perimenopause <em>and</em> beyond. The only version of too late is another year you didn't have to spend soaked and sleepless."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q6"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q6", "label": "Question", "default": "How does the subscription work — and can I cancel anytime?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a6", "label": "Answer", "default": "Subscribing gets you the best price with free shipping, and you're always in control: pause, skip, or cancel anytime, no hoops. You can also order a one-time purchase if you'd rather try it first. Our honest take: the real results land at month 3, and subscribers pay the lowest price to get there."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q7"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q7", "label": "Question", "default": "What if it doesn't work for me?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a7", "label": "Answer", "default": "Email us within 90 days for a full refund — no returns, no forms, no fine print. The gut-hormone axis doesn't reset overnight, and a 30-day guarantee would ask you to quit before the shift happens. We give you a full three months because that's what your body actually needs — and we're betting on you, not on the fine print."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q8"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q8", "label": "Question", "default": ""},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a8", "label": "Answer", "default": ""}
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
